{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49469","headline":"醉公子 一 · 顾敻","name":"醉公子 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"漠漠秋云澹，红藕香侵槛。\n枕倚小山屏，金铺向晚扃。\n睡起横波慢，独望情何限。\n衰柳数声蝉，魂销似去年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"顾敻","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49469.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49469","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}